message: "If you use this code or the processed data it contains, please cite the archived release (see the doi field, or the Zenodo record linked from this repository)."
title: "SP5C DAM-state benchmark: analysis code and processed data"
abstract: "Analysis code, exported per-cell CSVs, benchmark scripts and environment pins for a single-nucleus RNA-seq study of microglial DAM-like states in the mouse trigeminal spinal nucleus caudalis (Sp5C) under orofacial inflammatory pain. Contains the three benchmarks (DAM-state scoring definitions, cell-cell communication inference, batch integration) and the scripts that draw every manuscript figure; all figures are drawn from the shipped CSV exports only."
